text: ['Cast this spell only if a creature is attacking you.\\nCreate three 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has flying.', 'Flying', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Target blocking or blocked creature you control gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'When Spiritual Guardian enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life and draw a card.']
